{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-64933-r4517467","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Chocolate Squares","sourcePageId":64933,"sourceRevision":"4517467","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T02:37:20Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Chocolate%20Squares&oldid=4517467","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:38:16.285Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Easy recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for confections","Category:Recipes for cookies","Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour","Category:Recipes using baking soda","Category:Recipes using brown sugar","Category:Recipes using chocolate","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:Recipes using sweetened condensed milk","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"c64f865aafd06f244ec809cbd95b7cd8508db21e9e34287e03a3d99672decc87","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Confection recipes|time=30–35 minutes|difficulty=2\n}}\n__NOTOC__\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Confections|Confections]]\n\nA chocolate square recipe that tastes delicious.\n\n==Ingredients==\n===Base and topping===\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (120 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) [[Cookbook:margarine|margarine]], softened\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (240 g) [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n* 1 [[cookbook:egg|egg]] \n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:vanilla|vanilla]]\n* 1 ¼ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (300 g) [[Cookbook:Flour|all-purpose flour]]\n* 1 ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (350 g) rolled [[Cookbook:Oats|oat]]s\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Baking Soda|baking soda]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:salt|salt]]\n\n===Filling===\n* ⅔ [[Cookbook:cup|cup]] (160 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]]) [[Cookbook:Sweetened Condensed Milk|sweetened condensed milk]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:cup|cup]] (240 g) [[Cookbook:Chocolate Chips|chocolate chips]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] hard [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:vanilla|vanilla]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:salt|salt]]\n\n==Procedure==\n===Base and topping===\n#[[Cookbook:Creaming|Cream]] together the margarine and brown sugar until light and fluffy.\n#[[Cookbook:Beating|Beat]] in egg and vanilla.\n#In a mixing bowl, blend together the flour, oats, baking soda and salt.\n#Mix flour mixture into creamed mixture, using a wooden spoon to start, until crumbly looking.\n#Reserve roughly ⅓ of the mixture in a bowl and set aside.\n#Press remaining mixture into a greased, lined square pan.\n\n===Filling===\n#In a mixing bowl over a pot of boiling water, heat all filling ingredients until chocolate chips are just melted.\n#Spread chocolate mixture evenly over prepared base, keeping the sides of the pan clean.\n#Take reserved mixture and sprinkle over the top. Note that it will not cover the whole surface.\n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at [[Cookbook:Oven temperatures|350°F]] (180°C) for 20 to 25 minutes, or just until oatmeal mixture has a light golden colour.\n#Let cool, cut, and serve.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using chocolate]]\n[[Category:Recipes for cookies]]\n[[Category:Recipes for confections]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking soda]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sweetened condensed milk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Chocolate Squares","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"½ cup (120 g) margarine, softened","sourceText":"½ cup (120 g) margarine, softened","amountText":"½ cup (120 g) margarine, softened","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 cup (240 g) brown sugar","sourceText":"1 cup (240 g) brown sugar","amountText":"1 cup (240 g) brown sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 egg","sourceText":"1 egg","amountText":"1 egg","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 teaspoon vanilla","sourceText":"1 teaspoon vanilla","amountText":"1 teaspoon vanilla","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 ¼ cup (300 g) all-purpose flour","sourceText":"1 ¼ cup (300 g) all-purpose flour","amountText":"1 ¼ cup (300 g) all-purpose flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 ½ cup (350 g) rolled oats","sourceText":"1 ½ cup (350 g) rolled oats","amountText":"1 ½ cup (350 g) rolled oats","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"½ teaspoon baking soda","sourceText":"½ teaspoon baking soda","amountText":"½ teaspoon baking soda","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"½ teaspoon salt","sourceText":"½ teaspoon salt","amountText":"½ teaspoon salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"⅔ cup (160 ml) sweetened condensed milk","sourceText":"⅔ cup (160 ml) sweetened condensed milk","amountText":"⅔